<title>USA: News Corp Ltd Q3 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>News Corp Ltd Q3 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31.</p>
<p>Results in millions of Australian dollars</p>
<p>	    except per share figures</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		  A$0.11		   A$0.09</p>
<p> Oper net		     376			281</p>
<p> Revs			 3,737		    3,048</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.33		    $0.30</p>
<p> Oper net		   1,107			944</p>
<p> Revs			10,799		    9,827</p>
<p>NOTE: Oper profits exclude abnormal items.</p>
<p>Q3 abnormal items: A$46 million (A$0.02 a share) vs A$204 million (A$0.07 a share).</p>
<p>Nine month abnormal items: A$87 million (A$0.03 a share) vs A$165 million ($0.06 a share).</p>
<p>Q3 Operating profits after abnormal items: A$330 million (A$0.09 a share) vs A$77 million (A$0.02 a share).</p>
<p>Nine month operating profits after abnormal items: A$1.02 billion (A$0.30 a share) vs $779 million (A$0.24 a share.)</p>
</text>
